    "chunk_text": ", & cw\u00e6\u00f0: Beo strang & \u00c6fter \u00f0am \u00f0e Moyses wrat \u00f0isse \u00e6 bebodu, & \u00f0a gefylde, he bebead Leuies cynne, \u00f0e b\u00e6ron \u00f0a Ic can eower geflit & eowre heardheortnysse; On minum life, \u00f0a hwile \u00f0e ic mid eow ferde, \u00e6fre ge Gegaderia\u00f0 to me ealle \u00f0a betstborenan on eowrum cynne & lareowas, \u00f0\u00e6t hi gehyron mine word, & Ic wat \u00f0\u00e6t ge unrihtlice lybba\u00f0 \u00e6fter minum dea\u00f0e, & ge sona forl\u00e6ta\u00f0 \u00f0a \u00f0incg \u00f0e ic eow bebead, Moyses sp\u00e6c \u00f0as word beforan Israhela folce & hi fylde o\u00f0 ende, & \u00f0us cw\u00e6\u00f0. GEHYRA\u00f0 heofonas \u00f0a \u00f0ingc \u00f0e ic spece, & gehyre eor\u00f0e mine word. Weaxe min lar swa ren; flowe min sp\u00e6c swa deaw & swa smylte ren & swa dropan ofer g\u00e6rsa ci\u00f0as, Godes weorc synd fulfremede & ealle his wegas synd domas; Godd is getrywe, butan \u00e6lcere Him syngodon on unrihtwisum & na his gecorenan bearn; La yfele cneores. Agylts \u00f0u Drihtne \u00f0as \u00f0incg, stunt folc & unwis; Secge ge, nis he eower f\u00e6der, \u00f0e eow ahte & worhte Gemuna\u00f0 ealdra daga; ge\u00f0encea\u00f0 ealle cneoressa; axia\u00f0 eowre f\u00e6deras & hi cy\u00f0a\u00f0 eow, eowre \u00d0a se hehsta tod\u00e6lde \u00f0eoda; \u00f0a he ascyrede Adames bearn, he geset folca gem\u00e6ro \u00e6fter Israhela Drihtnes d\u00e6",
